  title: 'How to Stay Safe When Traveling Alone',
  excerpt: 'Solo travel can be incredibly rewarding, but being prepared makes the experience much easier. Here are practical ways to stay aware, protect your belongings, choose safer accommodation, and handle unexpected situations while traveling alone.',
