  title: 'Ancient Cities Every History-Loving Traveler Should Visit',
  excerpt: 'From Rome and Athens to Petra and Machu Picchu, discover some of the world’s most fascinating ancient cities and the stories that make them unforgettable.',
  category: 'Culture',
  readTime: '5 min read',
