  id: 'how-different-countries-celebrate-new-year',
  slug: 'how-different-countries-celebrate-new-year',
  title: 'How Different Countries Celebrate New Year',
  excerpt: 'From fireworks and family feasts to unique traditions and lucky rituals, discover how people around the world welcome the New Year.',
  category: 'Culture',
  readTime: '5 min read',
