  title: 'How to Make Your Travel eSIM Data Last Longer',
  excerpt: 'Traveling with a limited eSIM plan? Learn simple ways to reduce mobile data usage, avoid unnecessary background activity, and make your travel data last throughout your trip.',
  category: 'eSIM',
  readTime: '5 min read',
