  id: 'what-photos-dont-tell-you-about-a-hotel',
  slug: 'what-photos-dont-tell-you-about-a-hotel',
  title: 'What Photos Don’t Tell You About a Hotel',
  excerpt: 'Hotel photos can make a property look perfect, but they rarely show the complete experience. Learn what to look for beyond the pictures before booking your next stay.',
  category: 'Hotels',
  readTime: '5 min read',
