  title: 'How to Choose the Right Hotel for a Family Vacation',
  excerpt: 'The right family hotel can make a vacation easier, more comfortable, and less stressful. Learn what to consider when comparing rooms, locations, meals, facilities, safety, and overall value.',
  category: 'Hotels',
  readTime: '6 min read',
