  slug: 'how-to-choose-a-hotel-for-a-romantic-getaway',
  title: 'How to Choose a Hotel for a Romantic Getaway',
  excerpt: 'The right hotel can make a romantic trip feel effortless. Learn how to choose accommodation based on atmosphere, privacy, location, room features, dining, views, and the details that actually matter to couples.',
