  title: 'How to Find a Balance Between Tourist Attractions and Local Life',
  excerpt: 'The best trips often combine famous sights with ordinary local experiences. Learn how to see the places everyone talks about while still making time for neighborhood walks, local food, markets, and everyday life.',
  category: 'Travel Tips',
  readTime: '6 min read',
