  slug: 'how-to-recover-from-a-bad-first-day-on-vacation',
  title: 'How to Recover From a Bad First Day on Vacation',
  excerpt: 'A delayed flight, lost luggage, bad weather, or a disappointing hotel can make the first day of a trip feel like a disaster. Here is how to reset, solve the important problems, and still enjoy the rest of your vacation.',
  category: 'Travel Tips',
  readTime: '6 min read',
