  title: 'How to Decide How Many Days to Spend in a Destination',
  excerpt: 'Too few days can make a trip feel rushed, while too many can leave you wondering what to do next. Learn how to choose the right trip length based on what you want to see, how you travel, transportation, and the pace you prefer.',
  category: 'Travel Tips',
