  title: 'How to Travel Greece on a Budget: Flights, Hotels, Food & Transport',
  excerpt: 'Want to explore Greece without overspending? Learn practical ways to save on flights, accommodation, food, ferries, transport and attractions.',
  category: 'Travel Budget',
  destination: 'Greece',
