  title: 'How Much Does Qatar Really Cost? A Practical Trip Budget',
  excerpt: 'Planning a trip to Qatar? Here is how to think about the cost of flights, hotels, food, transport and activities so you can build a realistic travel budget.',
  category: 'Travel Budget',
