  id: '10-days-in-new-zealand-cities-lakes-and-mountains',
  slug: '10-days-in-new-zealand-cities-lakes-and-mountains',
  title: '10 Days in New Zealand: Cities, Lakes & Mountains',
  excerpt: 'A practical 10-day New Zealand itinerary combining Auckland, Queenstown, alpine lakes, mountain landscapes and a relaxed South Island road trip.',
