  slug: 'things-i-wish-i-knew-before-my-first-us-trip',
  title: 'Things I Wish I Knew Before My First US Trip',
  excerpt: 'Planning your first trip to the United States? Here are practical things to know about distances, transport, tipping, taxes, food, weather and everyday travel.',
  category: 'Travel Tips',
