  title: 'Why Switzerland Feels Different From Other European Countries',
  excerpt: 'Switzerland has a character of its own, from its multilingual cities and mountain villages to its food, transport and relationship with nature.',
  category: 'Destination Guides',
  destination: 'Switzerland',
  destinations: ['Switzerland'],
