  slug: '7-days-in-china-beijing-xian-and-shanghai',
  title: '7 Days in China: Beijing, Xi’an & Shanghai',
  excerpt: 'A practical one-week China itinerary covering Beijing, Xi’an and Shanghai, with a balance of history, food, culture and modern city life.',
  category: 'Itineraries',
  destination: 'China',
