  id: 'the-philippines-is-more-than-boracay',
  slug: 'the-philippines-is-more-than-boracay',
  title: 'The Philippines Is More Than Boracay',
  excerpt: 'Boracay may be famous, but the Philippines has thousands of islands to explore. Discover Palawan, Cebu, Siargao and other places that reveal a different side of the country.',
  category: 'Destination Guides',
  destination: 'Philippines',
  destinations: ['Philippines'],
  readTime: '5 min read',
