  title: 'How to Move Between Philippine Islands Without the Stress',
  excerpt: 'Island hopping in the Philippines is exciting, but getting between destinations can involve flights, ferries, vans and long transfers. Here is how to plan the journey more smoothly.',
  category: 'Travel Tips',
  destination: 'Philippines',
