  slug: 'eating-your-way-through-norways-coastal-towns',
  title: 'Eating Your Way Through Norway’s Coastal Towns',
  excerpt: 'Norway’s coastal towns offer more than beautiful views. Discover the seafood, traditional dishes, cafés and local flavors that make eating by the Norwegian coast part of the journey.',
  category: 'Food',
